program	const_length_grammar_bool_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	array length is not a compile-time constant: operator `&` on a Bool (its Bool form is `&&` / `||` / `not`) is not allowed here
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: array length is not a compile-time constant: operator `&` on a Bool (its Bool form is `&&` / `||` / `not`) is not allowed here"
log	"  --> examples/const_length_grammar_bool_error.saw:11:35"
log	"   hint: a length is fixed at compile time — use an integer literal, a const generic parameter, a module `static` of type `Int` or `UInt` whose own initializer folds, the integer limits, a raw-backed enum case, `sizeof`/`alignof` of a primitive or pointer type, or arithmetic and bitwise operators over any of those"
